ewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p030","text":"西伯歸，乃陰修德行善，諸侯多叛紂而往歸西伯。西伯滋大，紂由是稍失權重。王子比干諫，弗聽。商容賢者，百姓愛之，紂廢之。及西伯伐飢國，滅之，紂之臣祖伊聞之而咎周，恐，奔告紂曰：「天既訖我殷命，假人元龜，無敢知吉，非先王不相我後人，維王淫虐用自絕，故天棄我，不有安食，不虞知天性，不迪率典。今我民罔不欲喪，曰『天曷不降威，大命胡不至』？今王其柰何？」紂曰：「我生不有命在天乎！」祖伊反，曰：「紂不可諫矣。」西伯既卒，周武王之東伐，至盟津，諸侯叛殷會周者八百。諸侯皆曰：「紂可伐矣。」武王曰：「爾未知天命。」乃復歸。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000139","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000139","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000139","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0035","start":35,"end":39,"surface":"王子比干","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000147","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"商容","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000148","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000139","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"祖伊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000149","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","p