。紂走，入登鹿臺，衣其寶玉衣，赴火而死。周武王遂斬紂頭，縣之大白旗。殺妲己。釋箕子之囚，封比干之墓，表商容之閭。封紂子武庚祿父，以續殷祀，令修行盤庚之政。殷民大說。於是周武王為天子。其後世貶帝號，號為王。而封殷後為諸侯，屬周。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"微子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000135","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"大師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"少師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"比干","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000147","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"比干","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000147","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000151","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"大師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"少師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","